  <PersonalChronicle.Settings.TooSmall>窗口太小 —— 请拉大 Mod 设置窗口</PersonalChronicle.Settings.TooSmall>
  <PersonalChronicle.Settings.RowFailed>该行绘制异常，已隔离（详见日志）</PersonalChronicle.Settings.RowFailed>
  <PersonalChronicle.Settings.ReadOnly>（只读）</PersonalChronicle.Settings.ReadOnly>
